# HLS Proxy Streams Configuration
# Format: <rtsp-url> | <display-name>
#
# Examples:
#
# Basic stream (no authentication):
# rtsp://192.168.1.100:554/cam/realmonitor?channel=1&subtype=0 | Front Door
#
# Stream with inline credentials:
# rtsp://admin:password@192.168.1.101:554/stream1 | Backyard
#
# Stream with URL-encoded special characters in password:
# rtsp://admin:p%40ssw%21rd@192.168.1.102:554/stream1 | Garage
# Common encodings: @ = %40, ! = %21, # = %23, : = %3A, / = %2F
#
# Extended format with separate credentials (for complex passwords):
# -u admin p@ssw!rd rtsp://192.168.1.103:554/stream1 | Driveway
#
# Lorex camera examples:
# rtsp://192.168.1.100:554/cam/realmonitor?channel=1&subtype=0 | Front Door (Main)
# rtsp://192.168.1.100:554/cam/realmonitor?channel=1&subtype=1 | Front Door (Sub)
#
# Add your streams below:

rtsp://192.168.1.100:554/cam/realmonitor?channel=1&subtype=0 | Front Door
rtsp://192.168.1.101:554/cam/realmonitor?channel=1&subtype=0 | Back Yard
rtsp://admin:password@192.168.1.102:554/stream1 | Garage
